    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 20
    messageMargin: 16
    messageFontSize: 18
    noteFontSize: 18
    actorFontSize: 18
    width: 115
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant App as App / Store
  participant DB as Owned DB
  participant Ops as Deployment / test
  Ops->>DB: Add nullable detail
  Ops->>App: Deploy v2 writer
  Client->>App: POST v1 command<br/>Bearer token
  App->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE<br/>Read state and identity
  DB-->>App: State and saved result
  App->>App: Validate new command<br/>or replay saved result
  App->>DB: New only: HP, key, event
  alt Write failure
    App->>DB: ROLLBACK
    App-->>Client: 500 / retry identity
  else Commit succeeds
    App->>DB: COMMIT
    App-->>Client: 200 / outcome
  end
  Ops->>App: Verify HP with DB
  App-->>Ops: v2 response fault
  Ops->>App: Restart v1 writer
  App->>DB: Legacy column writes
  DB-->>Ops: Compatible schema<br/>v2 data preserved
  Note over App,DB: Store owns writes<br/>7-day event retention
